{'symbol': 'SEDG', 'date': '2022-12-08 15:30:00', 'title': 'INVESTOR ACTION REMINDER: THE SCHALL LAW FIRM ENCOURAGES INVESTORS IN SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. WITH LOSSES OF $100,000 TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES, CA / ACCESSWIRE / DECEMBER 8, 2022 / THE SCHALL LAW FIRM, A NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LITIGATION FIRM, ANNOUNCES THE FILING OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. ("SOLAREDGE" OR "THE COMPANY") (NASDAQ:SEDG) FOR VIOLATIONS OF 10(B) AND 20(A) OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934 AND RULE 10B-5 PROMULGATED THEREUNDER BY THE U.S. SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION. INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED THE COMPANY\'S SECURITIES BETWEEN AUGUST 6, 2022 AND OCTOBER 19, 2022, INCLUSIVE (THE \'\'CLASS PERIOD\'\'), ARE ENCOURAGED TO CONTACT THE FIRM BEFORE JANUARY 3, 2023.'}{'symbol': 'SEDG', 'date': '2022-12-08 12:30:00', 'title': 'SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (SEDG) SHAREHOLDER CLASS ACTION ALERT: BERNSTEIN LIEBHARD LLP REMINDS INVESTORS OF THE DEADLINE TO FILE A LEAD PLAINTIFF MOTION IN A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (SEDG)', 'text': 'DID YOU LOSE MONEY ON INVESTMENTS IN SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES? IF SO, PLEASE VISIT SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. SHAREHOLDER CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT OR CONTACT PETER ALLOCCO AT (212) 951-2030 OR PALLOCCO@BERNLIEB.COM TO DISCUSS YOUR RIGHTS.'}{'symbol': 'SEDG', 'date': '2022-12-08 09:02:00', 'title': 'INVESTOR ACTION ALERT: THE SCHALL LAW FIRM ENCOURAGES INVESTORS IN SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. WITH LOSSES OF $100,000 TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES, CALIFORNIA--(NEWSFILE CORP. - DECEMBER 8, 2022) - THE SCHALL LAW FIRM, A NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LITIGATION FIRM, ANNOUNCES THE FILING OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. ("SOLAREDGE" OR "THE COMPANY") (NASDAQ: SEDG) FOR VIOLATIONS OF §§10(B) AND 20(A) OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934 AND RULE 10B-5 PROMULGATED THEREUNDER BY THE U.S. SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION.'}{'symbol': 'SEDG', 'date': '2022-12-08 05:45:00', 'title': 'SEDG LAWSUIT ALERT: LEVI & KORSINSKY NOTIFIES SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND UPCOMING DEADLINE', 'text': 'NEW YORK , DEC. 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. ("SOLAREDGE" OR THE "COMPANY") (NASDAQ: SEDG) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT. CLASS DEFINITION: THE LAWSUIT SEEKS TO RECOVER LOSSES ON BEHALF OF SOLAREDGE INVESTORS WHO WERE ADVERSELY AFFECTED BY ALLEGED SECURITIES FRAUD.'}